                <div class="option-item"><strong>C.</strong> Irreversible binding affinity to pre-synaptic active zones.</div>
                <div class="option-item"><strong>D.</strong> Acetylcholine-like action and are not rapidly hydrolyzed by cholinesterase.</div>
